## 5. 定时任务执行流程图

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    subgraph TimingWheel[时间轮调度器]
        direction TB
        EventLoop[HierarchicalTimingWheel<br/>层次化时间轮]
        TaskQueue[任务队列]
        Executor[任务执行器]
    end
    
    subgraph AuthTasks[认证服务定时任务]
        direction TB
        SessionCleanup[会话清理任务<br/>每5分钟执行]
        TokenCleanup[令牌清理任务<br/>每10分钟执行]  
        HeartbeatTask[心跳任务<br/>每30秒执行]
        StatsCollection[统计收集任务<br/>每小时执行]
    end
    
    Start([事件循环启动]) --> EventLoop
    EventLoop --> TaskQueue
    TaskQueue --> Executor
    
    %% 任务注册
    SessionCleanup --> EventLoop
    TokenCleanup --> EventLoop
    HeartbeatTask --> EventLoop
    StatsCollection --> EventLoop
    
    %% 会话清理任务流程
    Executor -->|执行| SessionExec[会话清理执行]
    SessionExec --> GetExpiredSessions[查找过期会话]
    GetExpiredSessions --> RemoveSessions[删除过期会话]
    RemoveSessions --> ClearSessionCache[清理会话缓存]
    ClearSessionCache --> LogSessionCleanup[记录清理日志]
    LogSessionCleanup --> SessionComplete[会话清理完成]
    
    %% 令牌清理任务流程
    Executor -->|执行| TokenExec[令牌清理执行]
    TokenExec --> GetExpiredTokens[查找过期令牌]
    GetExpiredTokens --> RemoveTokens[删除过期令牌]
    RemoveTokens --> UpdateBlacklist[更新令牌黑名单]
    UpdateBlacklist --> ClearTokenCache[清理令牌缓存]
    ClearTokenCache --> LogTokenCleanup[记录清理日志]
    LogTokenCleanup --> TokenComplete[令牌清理完成]
    
    %% 心跳任务流程
    Executor -->|执行| HeartbeatExec[心跳任务执行]
    HeartbeatExec --> BuildHeartbeatData[构建心跳数据]
    BuildHeartbeatData --> IncludeAuthStats[包含认证统计]
    IncludeAuthStats --> SendToGateway[发送到API网关]
    SendToGateway --> HeartbeatResp{心跳响应}
    HeartbeatResp -->|成功| LogHeartbeatSuccess[记录心跳成功]
    HeartbeatResp -->|失败| LogHeartbeatFailure[记录心跳失败]
    LogHeartbeatSuccess --> HeartbeatComplete[心跳完成]
    LogHeartbeatFailure --> HeartbeatComplete
    
    %% 统计收集任务流程
    Executor -->|执行| StatsExec[统计收集执行]
    StatsExec --> CollectAuthStats[收集认证统计]
    CollectAuthStats --> CollectSessionStats[收集会话统计]
    CollectSessionStats --> CollectTokenStats[收集令牌统计]
    CollectTokenStats --> CollectUserServiceStats[收集用户服务统计]
    CollectUserServiceStats --> UpdateMetrics[更新性能指标]
    UpdateMetrics --> LogStatsUpdate[记录统计更新]
    LogStatsUpdate --> StatsComplete[统计收集完成]
    
    %% 任务重新调度
    SessionComplete --> RescheduleSession[重新调度会话清理]
    TokenComplete --> RescheduleToken[重新调度令牌清理]
    HeartbeatComplete --> RescheduleHeartbeat[重新调度心跳任务]
    StatsComplete --> RescheduleStats[重新调度统计收集]
    
    RescheduleSession --> TaskQueue
    RescheduleToken --> TaskQueue
    RescheduleHeartbeat --> TaskQueue
    RescheduleStats --> TaskQueue
    
    %% 样式
    classDef taskClass fill:#ffe1e1,stroke:#d32f2f,stroke-width:2px
    classDef execClass fill:#e1f5fe,stroke:#0277bd,stroke-width:2px
    classDef checkClass fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#f57c00,stroke-width:2px
    classDef completeClass fill:#e8f5e8,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:2px
    
    class SessionCleanup,TokenCleanup,HeartbeatTask,StatsCollection taskClass
    class SessionExec,TokenExec,HeartbeatExec,StatsExec execClass
    class HeartbeatResp checkClass
    class SessionComplete,TokenComplete,HeartbeatComplete,StatsComplete completeClass
```

