## 7. JWT令牌生命周期图

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> UserLogin: 用户登录/注册
    
    UserLogin --> TokenGeneration: 身份验证通过
    TokenGeneration --> ActiveTokens: 生成Access + Refresh Token
    
    state ActiveTokens {
        [*] --> AccessTokenValid
        AccessTokenValid --> AccessTokenExpired: 1小时后过期
        AccessTokenExpired --> TokenRefresh: 使用Refresh Token刷新
        TokenRefresh --> AccessTokenValid: 获得新的Access Token
        
        --
        [*] --> RefreshTokenValid
        RefreshTokenValid --> RefreshTokenExpired: 30天后过期
        RefreshTokenExpired --> ReAuthentication: 需要重新登录
    }
    
    ActiveTokens --> TokenValidation: API调用时验证
    TokenValidation --> TokenAccepted: 令牌有效
    TokenValidation --> TokenRejected: 令牌无效/过期
    
    TokenRejected --> TokenRefresh: 尝试自动刷新
    TokenRefresh --> ReAuthentication: 刷新失败
    
    TokenAccepted --> [*]: 继续API处理
    
    ActiveTokens --> UserLogout: 用户主动登出
    UserLogout --> TokenBlacklist: 令牌加入黑名单
    TokenBlacklist --> [*]: 令牌失效
    
    ActiveTokens --> TokenCleanup: 定时清理任务
    TokenCleanup --> [*]: 清理过期令牌
    
    ReAuthentication --> [*]: 重新开始流程
```

## 8. 错误处理流程图

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Request[接收认证请求] --> ValidateInput{输入验证}
    ValidateInput -->|JSON格式错误| BadRequest[400 Bad Request<br/>INVALID_JSON]
    ValidateInput -->|缺少必填字段| MissingFields[400 Bad Request<br/>MISSING_FIELDS]
    ValidateInput -->|有效| ProcessAuth[处理认证请求]
    
    ProcessAuth --> AuthType{认证类型}
    
    %% 登录流程错误处理
    AuthType -->|登录| LoginValidation{登录验证}
    LoginValidation -->|用户不存在| UserNotFound[401 Unauthorized<br/>INVALID_CREDENTIALS]
    LoginValidation -->|密码错误| InvalidPassword[401 Unauthorized<br/>INVALID_CREDENTIALS]
    LoginValidation -->|账户锁定| AccountLocked[401 Unauthorized<br/>ACCOUNT_LOCKED]
    LoginValidation -->|成功| Success[200 OK<br/>返回JWT令牌]
    
    %% 注册流程错误处理
    AuthType -->|注册| RegistrationValidation{注册验证}
    RegistrationValidation -->|用户名存在| UsernameExists[409 Conflict<br/>USERNAME_EXISTS]
    RegistrationValidation -->|邮箱存在| EmailExists[409 Conflict<br/>EMAIL_EXISTS]
    RegistrationValidation -->|密码太弱| WeakPassword[400 Bad Request<br/>WEAK_PASSWORD]
    RegistrationValidation -->|用户服务异常| UserServiceError[500 Internal Error<br/>USER_SERVICE_ERROR]
    RegistrationValidation -->|成功| RegistrationSuccess[201 Created<br/>返回用户信息和JWT令牌]
    
    %% 令牌验证错误处理
    AuthType -->|令牌验证| TokenValidation{令牌验证}
    TokenValidation -->|令牌无效| InvalidToken[401 Unauthorized<br/>INVALID_TOKEN]
    TokenValidation -->|令牌过期| TokenExpired[401 Unauthorized<br/>TOKEN_EXPIRED]
    TokenValidation -->|令牌被拉黑| TokenBlacklisted[401 Unauthorized<br/>TOKEN_BLACKLISTED]
    TokenValidation -->|成功| TokenValid[200 OK<br/>返回令牌信息]
    
    %% 令牌刷新错误处理
    AuthType -->|令牌刷新| RefreshValidation{刷新验证}
    RefreshValidation -->|刷新令牌无效| InvalidRefresh[401 Unauthorized<br/>INVALID_TOKEN]
    RefreshValidation -->|刷新令牌过期| RefreshExpired[401 Unauthorized<br/>TOKEN_EXPIRED]
    RefreshValidation -->|会话不存在| SessionNotFound[401 Unauthorized<br/>SESSION_NOT_FOUND]
    RefreshValidation -->|成功| RefreshSuccess[200 OK<br/>返回新的JWT令牌]
    
    %% 数据库错误处理
    ProcessAuth --> DatabaseOperation{数据库操作}
    DatabaseOperation -->|MySQL连接失败| MySQLError[500 Internal Error<br/>DATABASE_ERROR]
    DatabaseOperation -->|Redis连接失败| RedisError[记录警告,继续处理]
    DatabaseOperation -->|事务失败| TransactionError[500 Internal Error<br/>DATABASE_ERROR]
    DatabaseOperation -->|成功| Success
    
    %% 外部服务错误处理
    ProcessAuth --> ExternalService{外部服务调用}
    ExternalService -->|用户服务不可用| UserServiceDown[503 Service Unavailable<br/>USER_SERVICE_ERROR]
    ExternalService -->|API网关超时| GatewayTimeout[500 Internal Error<br/>GATEWAY_TIMEOUT]
    ExternalService -->|成功| Success
    
    %% 系统错误处理
    ProcessAuth --> SystemError{系统异常}
    SystemError --> LogError[记录详细错误日志]
    LogError --> InternalError[500 Internal Error<br/>INTERNAL_ERROR]
    
    %% 错误恢复机制
    RedisError --> ProcessAuth
    
    %% 错误响应格式化
    BadRequest --> FormatError[格式化错误响应]
    MissingFields --> FormatError
    UserNotFound --> FormatError
    InvalidPassword --> FormatError
    AccountLocked --> FormatError
    UsernameExists --> FormatError
    EmailExists --> FormatError
    WeakPassword --> FormatError
    UserServiceError --> FormatError
    InvalidToken --> FormatError
    TokenExpired --> FormatError
    TokenBlacklisted --> FormatError
