    InternalError --> FormatError
    
    FormatError --> ErrorResponse["统一错误响应<br/>{error: 错误信息, error_code: CODE, <br/>timestamp: time}"]
    
    Success --> SuccessResponse["成功响应<br/>{success: true, data: {...}, <br/>timestamp: time}"]
