## 9. 认证服务安全策略图

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    subgraph SecurityLayers[安全层次]
        direction TB
        Transport[传输层安全<br/>HTTPS/TLS]
        Authentication[身份认证层<br/>JWT Token]
        Authorization[授权控制层<br/>Role-Based Access]
        DataProtection[数据保护层<br/>加密存储]
    end
    
    subgraph AuthMechanisms[认证机制]
        direction TB
        PasswordAuth[密码认证<br/>bcrypt哈希]
        TokenAuth[令牌认证<br/>JWT签名验证]
        SessionMgmt[会话管理<br/>多设备支持]
        RefreshMechanism[令牌刷新<br/>自动更新机制]
    end
    
    subgraph SecurityPolicies[安全策略]
        direction TB
        PasswordPolicy[密码策略<br/>强度验证]
        LoginAttempts[登录限制<br/>失败次数控制]
        SessionTimeout[会话超时<br/>自动失效]
        TokenBlacklist[令牌黑名单<br/>撤销机制]
    end
    
    subgraph ThreatProtection[威胁防护]
        direction TB
        BruteForce[暴力破解防护<br/>登录限制]
        TokenHijacking[令牌劫持防护<br/>签名验证]
        SessionFixation[会话固定防护<br/>会话重新生成]
        CSRF[CSRF防护<br/>令牌验证]
    end
    
    %% 安全流程
    Transport --> Authentication
    Authentication --> Authorization
    Authorization --> DataProtection
    
    %% 认证机制关联
    PasswordAuth --> PasswordPolicy
    TokenAuth --> TokenBlacklist
    SessionMgmt --> SessionTimeout
    RefreshMechanism --> TokenAuth
    
    %% 威胁防护关联
    BruteForce --> LoginAttempts
    TokenHijacking --> TokenAuth
    SessionFixation --> SessionMgmt
    CSRF --> TokenAuth
    
    %% 样式
    classDef securityClass fill:#ffe1e1,stroke:#d32f2f,stroke-width:2px
    classDef authClass fill:#e8f5e8,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:2px
    classDef policyClass fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#f57c00,stroke-width:2px
    classDef protectionClass fill:#e1f5fe,stroke:#0277bd,stroke-width:2px
    
    class SecurityLayers securityClass
    class AuthMechanisms authClass
    class SecurityPolicies policyClass
    class ThreatProtection protectionClass
